{"diagnosis": "Loopback send 0xa5 returned 0xe9 per TRAP: uart data mismatch got 0xe9 want 0xa5. ser_tx at picosoc/simpleuart.v:107 shifts send_pattern LSB-first with shift at picosoc/simpleuart.v:131, but load at picosoc/simpleuart.v:126 via picosoc/picosoc.v:201 reg_dat_we path is {1'b1, reg_dat_di[7:0], 1'b1} so start bit is 1 not 0. With start stuck at idle the receiver's first falling edge is D1 of 0xa5, framing D2-D7+stop+idle as data which decodes to 0xe9, matching the trace.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -123,9 +123,9 @@
 			end else
 			if (reg_dat_we && !send_bitcnt) begin
-				send_pattern <= {1'b1, reg_dat_di[7:0], 1'b1};
+				send_pattern <= {1'b1, reg_dat_di[7:0], 1'b0};
 				send_bitcnt <= 10;
 				send_divcnt <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (replacing FAIL 0xdead), no TRAP: uart data mismatch, loopback 0xa5 OK"}

